              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Wendy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not make any changes other than I didn't have quite 1 1/2 pounds of asparagus. We used hickory chips. At one hour it was still very crisp. We gave it about 10 more minutes and it was perfect. The smoke was subtle and it was delicious. Will make it again anytime we are using the smoker. It is worth the hour.",
